<title>USA: Wachovia Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wachovia Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WONSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.99		     0.87</p>
<p> Net			163,100		  149,900</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Wachovia Corp said taxable equivalent net interest income rose $30.3 million or 7.8 percent in the first quarter.</p>
<p>Other operating revenue grew $17.6 million or 9.5 percent, led by deposit account service charges, credit card fee income, electronic banking revenue and trust service fees.</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses was $48 million vs $27.3 million.</p>
<p>Net loan losses were $48 million vs $27.2 million.</p>
</text>
